# Store text as LF; Git checks it out as CRLF on Windows. Without this the repo keeps
# whatever endings a file was committed with, so any editor or script that rewrites
# them produces a diff that changes nothing.
* text=auto

# Tracked spreadsheets are zip archives, and the sample decks are too - never let
# line-ending conversion near them.
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.png binary
